              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="7">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Simulate mono room impulse responses with pyroomacoustics: the image source method (ISM), plus ray tracing (RT) by default. Air absorption (ISO 9613-1) is always included, as in Simulate Binaural and Simulate Ambisonics. The reference of Simulate Binaural and Simulate Ambisonics.</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">f6980ff4-7096-4fa7-a4ea-0f87aa83a10d</item>
