                          </items>
                        </chunk>
                      </chunks>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="param_input" index="2">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Number of rays per source. Empty (default): Vorlaender's count for a direction's energy to 1 dB from the room's volume, at least 20000, the count Simulate Binaural and Simulate Ambisonics trace their own reference with. A larger number gives a smoother tail at a longer run. Ray tracing only.</item>
