                    <chunk name="param_input" index="3">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Length of the responses in seconds. Default: 1.5 times the longest Eyring reverberation time (0.5 to 12 s), traced again longer while the responses end before 2/3 of their T30, up to 12 s. A given duration is kept and warns when it cuts the decay. Ray tracing only.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">94e72f1c-9952-4558-9b43-bac118cc5cfa</item>
