                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Analyse impulse responses (IRs): acoustic parameters such as EDT, T20 and C50, and the time and frequency responses for Plot 2D, of each source-receiver pair chosen. Computed in the compas_acoustics worker.</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">509a8463-9826-4b30-ae7b-926e0f698d16</item>
