                      <items count="8">
                        <item name="Access" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">2</item>
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">ImpulseResponse object(s), as Simulate gives them. Sources and receivers are numbered over the responses as connected, in the order they come: the n-th distinct source (receiver) is source (receiver) n, so a filtered or reordered list renumbers the pairs.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">2e9fb98f-fcc3-41be-97ca-cb28e9f3f0d8</item>
