                        </chunk>
                      </chunks>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="param_output" index="0">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">One branch per source-receiver pair, path {receiver;source}: the list of acoustic parameters: 'EDT', 'T20', 'T30', 'C50', 'C80', 'D50', 'DRR', 'Ts', 'STI' (with its modulation transfer index per band), 'G', 'SPL' and 'LF'. G and SPL (the sound pressure level from the source's level at 1 m, overall A-weighted) only for a simulated response; LF, the early lateral energy fraction, only for an ambisonic one. Each title ends with ' - source to receiver'.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">b10dcb05-752a-47ba-a376-426b6adddeb4</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">parameters</item>
                        <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">parameters</item>
                        <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
