                            </item>
                          </items>
                        </chunk>
                      </chunks>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="param_output" index="1">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">One branch per source-receiver pair, path {receiver;source}: the impulse response against time, for Plot 2D or a panel: the W channel of an ambisonic response, both ears (left, right) of a binaural one. Right-click the output to choose the scale: dB (default), the level re the peak, floored 100 dB below it, over the whole response; or linear, the amplitude, ending 5 % after the Schroeder curve has fallen 60 dB, below which the amplitude is not visible. The parameters and the frequency output use the whole response.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">9c3e8d7e-45f3-4723-94cb-fbad51f2f72b</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">time</item>
