                              <H>20</H>
                            </item>
                            <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                              <X>1878.5</X>
                              <Y>460</Y>
                            </item>
                          </items>
                        </chunk>
                      </chunks>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="param_output" index="2">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">One branch per source-receiver pair, path {receiver;source}: the frequency response, 1/3-octave smoothed, 20 Hz to 20 kHz in dB re the peak, for Plot 2D or a panel: the W channel of an ambisonic response, both ears (left, right) of a binaural one.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c997fa92-d345-4683-87f1-9d538f66f105</item>
